  "name": "Turn Shopify products into Veo 3.1 videos for TikTok, Instagram Reels and YouTube Shorts",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "99d0f2d8-b783-4726-a853-52384f46e38d",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -647,
        -97
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 833,
        "content": "## Turn every new Shopify product into a short video\nWhen a product is added to your Shopify store, Gemini looks at its photo, Veo 3.1 renders an 8-second vertical product video, and PostWire posts it to TikTok, Instagram Reels and YouTube Shorts with a caption written for each network.\n\n### How it works\n1. **New product in Shopify** fires when a product is created. **Active with a photo** drops drafts, and **Skip products already filmed** ignores one handled before.\n2. **Look at the product photo** (Gemini) describes what it sees and writes the Veo prompt and one selling point. **Build the brief** adds the name, price and product link.\n3. **Veo 3.1 render** generates the clip in 9:16.\n4. **Post to TikTok, Reels and Shorts** (PostWire) uploads the file, writes a caption per network and publishes.\n5. **Log the video** adds a row per network with its link. A refusal goes to **Log the failure**, and **Email me the fix** sends what to fix.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the verified **PostWire** node (search \"PostWire\" in the nodes panel), create an account at postwire.io, connect your networks and paste your API key into a **PostWire API** credential.\n2. Add a Shopify access token credential to the trigger, and your store address and email in **Store settings**.\n3. Add a Google Gemini credential to both Gemini nodes. Veo needs billing enabled in Google AI Studio (about one dollar per 8-second Veo 3.1 Fast clip).\n4. Create a sheet with the columns date, product, network, status, link and note, and pick it in both Sheets nodes. Connect Gmail.\n\n### Customize\nChange the visual style in Store settings, add facebook to the PostWire node (the free PostWire plan posts to 2 networks per post), or switch the trigger to Product Updated."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
